SUMMARY:Tie Dye!
DESCRIPTION:It’s summer\, and you know what that means…Tie Dye! In this one-day workshop\, students will learn about the tie-dye process and explore a variety of techniques to create colorful\, one-of-a-kind designs. Bring a cotton item or two and get ready to transform them with your own groovy creations!\n● A limited number of tote bags and shirts will be available\n● All tie-dye supplies and materials will be provided\n● Children under 8 must be accompanied by an adult\nInstructor: Courtney Siperstein-Cook\nAGES 6+\nPrice: $50\nTime: 10:00a-12:00p\nWorkshop date:\nSaturday\, August 8
